# Model names that trigger the cross-tool skills.
# Format: <family> <name> [<cli-model>]   families: claude | openai
# <cli-model> is the exact name the tool's CLI accepts. Omit it for a family
# name (Claude, GPT) that means "the tool's default model".
# Edit by hand or via update-models.sh, then run `update-models.sh render`.
claude Claude
claude Anthropic
claude Fable fable
claude Opus opus
claude Sonnet sonnet
claude Haiku haiku
openai Codex
openai OpenAI
openai GPT
openai astra gpt-6-astra
openai sol gpt-5.6-sol
openai terra gpt-5.6-terra
openai luna gpt-5.6-luna
